    "description": {
      "value": "A helm of underwater action is a streamlined sallet with a visor and a flanged rear. While wearing the helmet with the visor down, you can see, hear, and speak clearly underwater. You also have a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to Swim.\n\n- **Activate:** 3 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou can breathe underwater for 8 hours.\n\nDuring this time, you have a swim Speed equal to your land Speed.\n\nThe helm grants a +2 item bonus. Its activation lasts until your next daily preparations."
